id: pm-starter-failure-first-recipes
title: Recover read-only tasks from native refusals
description: "Acceptance: missing item, unsupported capability and insufficient budget recipes use real non-git trackers, assert native code and structured remedy, execute corrected read-only invocation, and never scrape human error prose. Provide typed SDK and agent-sized JSON/TOON CLI, README and runnable example, strict boundary and extreme-value tests, revert proof, read-only public tracker measurements, and npm/Bun CI release gates."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
